      "description": "<p>Initial release. Load custom hideout production recipes into SPT by placing JSON files in the <code>recipes</code> folder.</p>\n<h2>What’s new</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Automatically loads all <code>.json</code> files from the <code>recipes</code> folder on server start</li>\n<li>Supports multiple files — any name works</li>\n<li>Logs loaded recipe count and errors in the server console</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Download <code>TarkovCraft-Loader.zip</code></li>\n<li>Drag and drop the contents into your SPT root folder</li>\n<li>Let the folders merge</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Notes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Use the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://vinihns.github.io/TarkovCraft/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">TarkovCraft website</a> to generate recipe JSON files easily</li>\n<li>Malformed JSON or invalid item IDs are skipped and logged as errors</li>\n</ul>\n",
